>> title: Shortbread Cookies
>> category: Cookies
>> tags: butter, scottish, dessert, oven
>> counters: Bakery
>> aka: shortbread, Scottish shortbread, shortbread fingers, petticoat tails
>> pairs-with: lemon-curd
>> servings: 16
>> time: 1 hour
>> step.5: press into the pan, prick all over

Heat the #oven{} to 325°F (165°C) and butter an #8x8-in pan{}.

Cream @unsalted butter{1%cup}(226 g; softened) with @granulated sugar{1/2%cup}(100 g), @vanilla extract{1%tsp}(5 mL).

Whisk @all-purpose flour{2 1/2%cup}(315 g), @cornstarch{2%Tbs}(16 g), and @table salt{1/2%tsp}(3 g).

Stir @&(~1)dry ingredients{} into @&(~2)creamed butter{}.

Press @&(~1)dough{} into the pan and prick all over with a #fork{}.

Bake @&(~1)shortbread{} at 325°F for ~{45%min}.
